  "query_preview": "(Thursday through Sunday)...\nLow pressure over the western states will weaken with a warming\ntrend for southwestern California for Thursday into next weekend.\nwith high temperatures on Saturday a few degrees above average \nfor the deserts to a few degrees below average for the valleys. \nHigh temperatures on Saturday will range from the 70s near the \ncoast to the mid 80s to lower 90s for the Inland Empire with 102 \nto 106 for the lower deserts. Not much change is expected for \nSunday.",
